# Workspace

Session files live under `.cursor/workspace/` (handoffs, context, journals,
plans, artifacts, archive). Procedures belong in `fly-*` skills, not in
`AGENTS.md`.

- Prefer `.cursor/workspace/` when it exists.
- Do not invent a second journal or handoff tree.
- Do not put session files under `.cursor/skills/` or `~/.cursor/plans/`.
- Start a cold session with `fly-onboard`; confirm non-trivial work with
  `fly-confirm-align`; close with `fly-handoff`.
- `.cursor/skills`, `rules`, and `hooks` are tracked. Journals, artifacts,
  archive, and local plans are gitignored (READMEs stay). `AGENTS.md` is
  the tracked contract.
- Write only in this workshop repo. Do not edit a sibling SkyFlies tree.
